@*
    Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬
    CymBuild Dynamic Property Renderer
    Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬
    PURPOSE:
    Renders metadata-driven input controls (text, number, date, GUID, file, dropdown)
    dynamically based on `EntityProperty` and `DataProperty`.
    Enables UI flexibility in forms like `EditPage.razor`, `BulkEdit`, and dynamic modals.

    Ã°Å¸â€Â REPLACES:
    Hardcoded forms or field-by-field Blazor layouts
    Ã¢Å¾Å“
    Fully dynamic, auto-validating, metadata-controlled rendering for all field types.

    Ã°Å¸â€œâ€™ SUPPORTED TYPES:
    - Text: NVARCHAR(MAX)
    - Boolean: BIT
    - Integer: INT, BIGINT, SMALLINT, TINYINT
    - Decimal: DOUBLE
    - Date/Time: DATE, DATETIME2
    - GUID: UNIQUEIDENTIFIER
    - File/Signature: VARBINARY
    - Dropdowns: With DropDownListDefinitionGuid
    - Readonly variations for restricted properties

    Ã°Å¸Â§Â  LOGIC:
    - Renders label, input, validation UI, info/detail buttons, and field interactivity
    - Respects `IsRestricted`, `IsReadOnly`, `IsInvalid`, mobile visibility rules, and `EntityDataTypeName`
    - Includes interactive components:
        Ã¢â‚¬Â¢ <TelerikComboBox> with dynamic lookup
        Ã¢â‚¬Â¢ <TelerikDatePicker>, <TelerikDateTimePicker> with steps
        Ã¢â‚¬Â¢ <SignatureControl> for binary input
        Ã¢â‚¬Â¢ Modal popup for linked DetailPage/InformationPage via `EntityProperty.*Uri`

    Ã°Å¸â€ºÂ Ã¯Â¸Â DEPENDENCIES:
    - Requires:
        Ã¢â‚¬Â¢ EntityProperty, DataProperty, GuidValueBinding, etc.
        Ã¢â‚¬Â¢ Injected Services: `UserService`, `DeviceInfoService`, `UserInteractionTrackerService`
        Ã¢â‚¬Â¢ Telerik UI components
        Ã¢â‚¬Â¢ SignatureControl (custom)
        Ã¢â‚¬Â¢ ModalService + StateService for dynamic page rendering

    Ã°Å¸Â§Â© TEMPLATING NOTES:
    - Use `ItemTemplate` for colorized drop-down items (e.g., Sage highlight)
    - All value bindings (@bind-Value) respect BlazorÃ¢â‚¬â„¢s change tracking and validation
    - Supports both single-record and BulkEdit scenarios

    Ã°Å¸Â§Âª QA HIGHLIGHTS:
    - Field-specific validation messaging
    - Real-time interaction logging via `UserInteractionTrackerService`
    - Mobile conditional suppression of heavy UI (e.g. dropdowns or modals)
    - Compatibility with all supported DB field types via metadata

    Ã¢Å¡Â Ã¯Â¸Â CAVEATS:
    - Large componentÃ¢â‚¬â€consider refactoring into sub-controls for testability & reuse
    - Ensure dropdown GUIDs and `EntityDataTypeName` mappings are synchronized in metadata

*@

@using System.Dynamic
@using Concursus.API.Client.Models
@using Concursus.API.Core
@using Concursus.PWA.Classes
@using Google.Protobuf.WellKnownTypes
@using Concursus.Components.Shared.Services
@inject Core.CoreClient CoreClient
@inject NavigationManager NavManager
@inject StateService stateService
@inject ModalService modalService
@inject UserService userService
@inject DeviceInfoService DeviceInfoService
@inject UserInteractionTrackerService InteractionTracker
@inject IJSRuntime JS

@if (!(EntityProperty.IsHidden || DataProperty.IsHidden))
{
    @if (EntityProperty.DropDownListDefinitionGuid != Guid.Empty.ToString())
    {
        @if (!DeviceInfoService.IsMobile || (DeviceInfoService.IsMobile && EntityProperty.ShowOnMobile))
        {
            <div class="shore-input-field" style="width: 100%; min-width: 0; max-width: 100%;">
                <div class="input-group" title="@ValueTooltip" @onmousedown="HandleLookupUserInteractionAsync" @onfocusin="HandleLookupUserInteractionAsync">
                    <div class="input-group-text" title="@ValueTooltip">
                        <label for="@PropertyId" title="@LabelTooltip">@PropertyName</label>
                    </div>
                    @if (IsBulkEdit)
                    {
                        @if (DataProperty.IsRestricted)
                        {
                            <div class="combo-wrapper @(DataProperty.IsInvalid ? "is-invalid" : "is-data-valid")">
                                <ShoreLookupInput Value="@(DataProperty.IsRestricted && !IsBulkEdit ? Guid.Empty : GuidValueBinding)"
                  ValueChanged="@OnNativeLookupValueChangedAsync"
                  LoadItems="@LoadNativeLookupItemsAsync"
                  OnUserInteraction="@HandleLookupUserInteractionAsync"
                  ReloadKey="@_lookupRefreshKey"
                  Placeholder="@Placeholder"
                  Id="@PropertyId"
                  ReadOnly="@((DataProperty.IsRestricted && !IsBulkEdit) || DataProperty.IsReadOnly || EffectiveDisabled)"
                  IsInvalid="@DataProperty.IsInvalid"
                  DropDownListDefinitionGuid="@EntityProperty.DropDownListDefinitionGuid"
                  CssClass="w-100" />

                            </div>
                        }
                        else
                        {

                            <div class="combo-wrapper @(DataProperty.IsInvalid ? "is-invalid" : "is-data-valid")">
                                <ShoreLookupInput Value="@(DataProperty.IsRestricted && !IsBulkEdit ? Guid.Empty : GuidValueBinding)"
                  ValueChanged="@OnNativeLookupValueChangedAsync"
                  LoadItems="@LoadNativeLookupItemsAsync"
                  OnUserInteraction="@HandleLookupUserInteractionAsync"
                  ReloadKey="@_lookupRefreshKey"
                  Placeholder="@Placeholder"
                  Id="@PropertyId"
                  ReadOnly="@((DataProperty.IsRestricted && !IsBulkEdit) || DataProperty.IsReadOnly || EffectiveDisabled)"
                  IsInvalid="@DataProperty.IsInvalid"
                  DropDownListDefinitionGuid="@EntityProperty.DropDownListDefinitionGuid"
                  CssClass="w-100" />
                            </div>
                            @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(EntityProperty.DetailPageUri) && !DeviceInfoService.IsMobile)
                            {
                                <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="button" @onclick="HandleOnClick">
                                    <span class="bi bi-arrow-up-right-square"></span>
                                </button>
                            }
                            @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(EntityProperty.InformationPageUri) && @GuidValueBinding != Guid.Empty)
                            {
                                <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="button" @onclick="HandleModelOnClick">
                                    <span class="bi bi bi-info-circle"></span>
                                </button>
                            }
                            @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(EntityProperty.ExternalSearchPageUrl) && !DeviceInfoService.IsMobile)
                            {
                                <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="button" @onclick="() => OpenLinkInNewTab(EntityProperty.ExternalSearchPageUrl)">
                                    <span class="bi bi-search"></span>
                                </button>
                            }
                            @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(EntityProperty.HelpText))
                            {
                                <div class="dropdown">
                                    <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary dropdown-toggle"
                                            type="button"
                                            data-bs-toggle="dropdown">
                                        <span class="bi bi-info-circle"></span>
                                    </button>

                                    <div class="dropdown-menu p-3">
                                        <div class="fw-semibold mb-2">
                                            @EntityProperty.HelpText
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            }

                        }
                    }
                    else
                    {
                        @if (DataProperty.IsRestricted)
                        {
                            <div class="combo-wrapper">
                                <ShoreLookupInput Value="@(DataProperty.IsRestricted && !IsBulkEdit ? Guid.Empty : GuidValueBinding)"
                  ValueChanged="@OnNativeLookupValueChangedAsync"
                  LoadItems="@LoadNativeLookupItemsAsync"
                  OnUserInteraction="@HandleLookupUserInteractionAsync"
                  ReloadKey="@_lookupRefreshKey"
                  Placeholder="@Placeholder"
                  Id="@PropertyId"
                  ReadOnly="@((DataProperty.IsRestricted && !IsBulkEdit) || DataProperty.IsReadOnly || EffectiveDisabled)"
                  IsInvalid="@DataProperty.IsInvalid"
                  DropDownListDefinitionGuid="@EntityProperty.DropDownListDefinitionGuid"
                  CssClass="w-100" />
                            </div>
                        }
                        else
                        {
                            @if (!DeviceInfoService.IsMobile || (DeviceInfoService.IsMobile && EntityProperty.ShowOnMobile))
                            {
                                <div class="combo-wrapper @(DataProperty.IsInvalid ? "is-invalid" : "is-data-valid")">

                                    <ShoreLookupInput Value="@(DataProperty.IsRestricted && !IsBulkEdit ? Guid.Empty : GuidValueBinding)"
                  ValueChanged="@OnNativeLookupValueChangedAsync"
                  LoadItems="@LoadNativeLookupItemsAsync"
                  OnUserInteraction="@HandleLookupUserInteractionAsync"
                  ReloadKey="@_lookupRefreshKey"
                  Placeholder="@Placeholder"
                  Id="@PropertyId"
                  ReadOnly="@((DataProperty.IsRestricted && !IsBulkEdit) || DataProperty.IsReadOnly || EffectiveDisabled)"
                  IsInvalid="@DataProperty.IsInvalid"
                  DropDownListDefinitionGuid="@EntityProperty.DropDownListDefinitionGuid"
                  CssClass="w-100" />
                                </div>
                            }
                            @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(EntityProperty.DetailPageUri) && !DeviceInfoService.IsMobile)
                            {
                                <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="button" @onclick="HandleOnClick">
                                    <span class="bi bi-arrow-up-right-square"></span>
                                </button>
                            }
                            @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(EntityProperty.InformationPageUri) && @GuidValueBinding != Guid.Empty)
                            {
                                <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="button" @onclick="HandleModelOnClick">
                                    <span class="bi bi bi-info-circle"></span>
                                </button>
                            }
                            @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(EntityProperty.ExternalSearchPageUrl) && !DeviceInfoService.IsMobile)
                            {
                                <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="button" @onclick="() => OpenLinkInNewTab(EntityProperty.ExternalSearchPageUrl)">
                                    <span class="bi bi-search"></span>
                                </button>
                            }


                            <div class="invalid-feedback">
                                @DataProperty.ValidationMessage
                            </div>
                            <div class="valid-feedback"></div>
                        }
                    }


                </div>
            </div>
        }
    }
    else
    {

        @if (IsBulkEdit) //CBLD-260
        {
            @if (DataProperty.IsRestricted)
            {
                @switch (EntityProperty.EntityDataTypeName)
                {
                    case "NVARCHAR(MAX)":
                        <div class="shore-input-multiline-field" style="width: 100%; min-width: 0; max-width: 100%;">
                            <div class="input-group shore-input-multiline-group" title="@ValueTooltip">
                                <div class="input-group-text" title="@ValueTooltip">
                                    <label for="@PropertyId" title="@LabelTooltip">@PropertyName</label>
                                </div>
                                <textarea class="form-control form-control-sm shore-input-multiline-textarea" rows="5"
                                          id="@PropertyId"
                                          name="@PropertyName" placeholder="@Placeholder" @onblur="HandleOnBlur" @oninput="HandleOnChange" readonly="true"></textarea>

                            </div>
                        </div>
                        break;
                    case "BIT":
                        <div class="shore-input-field" style="width: 100%; min-width: 0; max-width: 100%;">
                            <div class="input-group" title="@ValueTooltip">
                                <div class="input-group-text" title="@ValueTooltip">
                                    <input class="form-check-input mt-0"
                                           type="checkbox"
                                           id="@PropertyId"
                                           name="@PropertyName"
                                           value="false"
                                           disabled="true">
                                </div>
                                <label class="form-control" for="@PropertyId" title="@LabelTooltip"></label>

                            </div>
                        </div>
                        break;
                    case "BIGINT":
                        <div class="shore-input-field" style="width: 100%; min-width: 0; max-width: 100%;">
                            <div class="input-group" title="@ValueTooltip">
                                <div class="input-group-text" title="@ValueTooltip">
                                    <label for="@PropertyId" title="@LabelTooltip">@PropertyName</label>
                                </div>
                                <input type="number"
                                       class="form-control form-control-sm)"
                                       id="@PropertyId" name="@PropertyName" placeholder="@Placeholder" value="-1" readonly="true">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        break;
                    case "INT":
                    case "SMALLINT":
                    case "TINYINT":
                        <div class="shore-input-field" style="width: 100%; min-width: 0; max-width: 100%;">
                            <div class="input-group" title="@ValueTooltip">
                                <div class="input-group-text" title="@ValueTooltip">
                                    <label for="@PropertyId" title="@LabelTooltip">@PropertyName</label>
                                </div>
                                <input type="number"
                                       class="form-control form-control-sm)"
                                       id="@PropertyId" name="@PropertyName" placeholder="@Placeholder" value="-1" readonly="true">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        break;
                    case "DOUBLE":
                        <div class="shore-input-field" style="width: 100%; min-width: 0; max-width: 100%;">
                            <div class="input-group" title="@ValueTooltip">
                                <div class="input-group-text" title="@ValueTooltip">
                                    <label for="@PropertyId" title="@LabelTooltip">@PropertyName</label>
                                </div>
                                <input type="number"
                                       step="@StepValue"
                                       class="form-control form-control-sm)"
                                       id="@PropertyId" name="@PropertyName" placeholder="@Placeholder" value="0" readonly="true">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        break;
                    case "UNIQUEIDENTIFIER":
                        <div class="shore-input-field" style="width: 100%; min-width: 0; max-width: 100%;">
                            <div class="input-group" title="@ValueTooltip">
                                <div class="input-group-text" title="@ValueTooltip">
                                    <label for="@PropertyId" title="@LabelTooltip">@PropertyName</label>
                                </div>
                                <input type="@InputType"
                                       class="form-control)"
                                       id="@PropertyId" name="@PropertyName" placeholder="@Placeholder" value="@_emptyGuid" readonly="true">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        break;
                    case "DATE":
                        <div class="shore-input-field" style="width: 100%; min-width: 0; max-width: 100%;">
                            <div class="input-group" title="@ValueTooltip">
                                <div class="input-group-text" title="@ValueTooltip">
                                    <label for="@PropertyId" title="@LabelTooltip">@PropertyName</label>
                                </div>
                                <div class="combo-wrapper)">
                                    <input type="date"
                                           class="form-control form-control-sm shore-input-native-date value-null"
                                           id="@DatePickerId"
                                           min="@NativeDateMin"
                                           max="@NativeDateMax"
                                           value=""
                                           disabled />
                                </div>

                            </div>
                        </div>
                        break;
                    case "VARBINARY":
                        <div class="shore-input-field" style="width: 100%; min-width: 0; max-width: 100%;">
                            <div class="input-group" title="@ValueTooltip">
                                <div class="input-group-text" title="@ValueTooltip">
                                    <label for="@PropertyId" title="@LabelTooltip">@PropertyName</label>
                                </div>
                                @* <SignatureControl ExistingSignature="@existingSignature" OnSignatureSaved="OnSignatureSaved" /> *@
                                <SignatureControl ExistingSignature="@existingSignature" OnSignatureCleared="HandleSignatureCleared" OnSignatureSaved="HandleSignatureSaved" user="@user" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        break;
                    case "DATETIME2":
                        <div class="shore-input-field" style="width: 100%; min-width: 0; max-width: 100%;">
                            <div class="input-group" title="@ValueTooltip">
                                <div class="input-group-text" title="@ValueTooltip">
                                    <label for="@PropertyId" title="@LabelTooltip">@PropertyName</label>
                                </div>
                                <div class="combo-wrapper)">
                                    <input type="datetime-local"
                                           class="form-control form-control-sm shore-input-native-date-time value-null"
                                           id="@DatePickerId"
                                           min="@NativeDateTimeMin"
                                           max="@NativeDateTimeMax"
                                           step="900"
                                           value=""
                                           disabled />
                                </div>

                            </div>
                        </div>
                        break;
                    default:
                        <div class="shore-input-field" style="width: 100%; min-width: 0; max-width: 100%;">
                            <div class="input-group" title="@ValueTooltip">
                                <div class="input-group-text" title="@ValueTooltip">
                                    <label for="@PropertyId" title="@LabelTooltip">@PropertyName</label>
                                </div>
                                <input @ref="@InputRef"
                                       type="@InputType"
                                       class="form-control"
                                       id="@PropertyId"
                                       name="@PropertyName"
                                       placeholder="@Placeholder"
                                       value=""
                                       readonly="true">
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            break;
                        }
                }
            else
                {
                    if (!DeviceInfoService.IsMobile || (@EffectiveDisabled))
                    {
                        @switch (EntityProperty.EntityDataTypeName)
                        {
                            case "NVARCHAR(MAX)":
                                <div class="shore-input-multiline-field" style="width: 100%; min-width: 0; max-width: 100%;">
                                    <div class="input-group shore-input-multiline-group" title="@ValueTooltip">
                                        <div class="input-group-text" title="@ValueTooltip">
                                            <label for="@PropertyId" title="@LabelTooltip">@PropertyName</label>
                                        </div>
                                        <textarea class="form-control form-control-sm shore-input-multiline-textarea @(DataProperty.IsInvalid ? "is-invalid" : "is-data-valid")" rows="5"
                                                  id="@PropertyId"
                                                  name="@PropertyName" placeholder="@Placeholder" @onblur="HandleOnBlur" @oninput="HandleOnChange"
                                                      readonly="@((DataProperty.IsReadOnly || Disabled || (@EffectiveDisabled)))">
                                        @StringValueBinding
                                    </textarea>
                                            @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(EntityProperty.HelpText))
                                            {
                                                <div class="dropdown">
                                                    <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary dropdown-toggle"
                                                            type="button"
                                                            data-bs-toggle="dropdown">
                                                        <span class="bi bi-info-circle"></span>
                                                    </button>

                                                    <div class="dropdown-menu p-3">
                                                        <div class="fw-semibold mb-2">
                                                            @EntityProperty.HelpText
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            }

                                            <div class="invalid-feedback">
                                                @DataProperty.ValidationMessage
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="valid-feedback"></div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    break;
                        case "BIT":
                                        <div class="shore-input-field" style="width: 100%; min-width: 0; max-width: 100%;">
                                            <div class="input-group" title="@ValueTooltip">
                                                <div class="input-group-text" title="@ValueTooltip">
                                                    <input class="form-check-input mt-0 @(DataProperty.IsInvalid ? "is-invalid" : "is-data-valid")"
                                                           type="checkbox"
                                                           id="@PropertyId"
                                                           name="@PropertyName"
                                                           @bind="@BoolValueBinding"
                                                           disabled="@((DataProperty.IsReadOnly || Disabled || (@EffectiveDisabled)))">
                                                    </div>
                                                    <label class="form-control @(DataProperty.IsInvalid ? "is-invalid" : "is-data-valid")" for="@PropertyId" title="@LabelTooltip">@PropertyName</label>
                                                    <div class="invalid-feedback">
                                                        @DataProperty.ValidationMessage
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="valid-feedback"></div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            break;
                        case "BIGINT":
                                                <div class="shore-input-field" style="width: 100%; min-width: 0; max-width: 100%;">
                                                    <div class="input-group" title="@ValueTooltip">
                                                        <div class="input-group-text" title="@ValueTooltip">
                                                            <label for="@PropertyId" title="@LabelTooltip">@PropertyName</label>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <input type="number"
                                                               class="form-control form-control-sm @(DataProperty.IsInvalid ? "is-invalid" : "is-data-valid")"
                                                               id="@PropertyId" name="@PropertyName" placeholder="@Placeholder" @bind-value="BigIntValueBinding"
                                                               readonly="@((DataProperty.IsReadOnly || Disabled || (@EffectiveDisabled)))">
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="invalid-feedback">
                                                            @DataProperty.ValidationMessage
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="valid-feedback"></div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    break;
                        case "INT":
                                                    case "SMALLINT":
                                                    case "TINYINT":
                                                        <div class="shore-input-field" style="width: 100%; min-width: 0; max-width: 100%;">
                                                            <div class="input-group" title="@ValueTooltip">
                                                                <div class="input-group-text" title="@ValueTooltip">
                                                                    <label for="@PropertyId" title="@LabelTooltip">@PropertyName</label>
                                                                </div>
                                                                <input type="number"
                                                                       class="form-control form-control-sm @(DataProperty.IsInvalid ? "is-invalid" : "is-data-valid")"
                                                                       id="@PropertyId" name="@PropertyName" placeholder="@Placeholder" @bind-value="IntValueBinding"
                                                                       readonly="@((DataProperty.IsReadOnly || Disabled || (@EffectiveDisabled)))">
                                                                    <div class="invalid-feedback">
                                                                        @DataProperty.ValidationMessage
                                                                    </div>
                                                                    <div class="valid-feedback"></div>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                            break;
                        case "DOUBLE":
                                                                <div class="shore-input-field" style="width: 100%; min-width: 0; max-width: 100%;">
                                                                    <div class="input-group" title="@ValueTooltip">
                                                                        <div class="input-group-text" title="@ValueTooltip">
                                                                            <label for="@PropertyId" title="@LabelTooltip">@PropertyName</label>
                                                                        </div>
                                                                        <input type="number"
                                                                               step="@StepValue"
                                                                               class="form-control form-control-sm @(DataProperty.IsInvalid ? "is-invalid" : "is-data-valid")"
                                                                               id="@PropertyId" name="@PropertyName" placeholder="@Placeholder" @bind-value="DoubleValueBinding"
                                                                               readonly="@((DataProperty.IsReadOnly || Disabled || (@EffectiveDisabled)))">
                                                                            <div class="invalid-feedback">
                                                                                @DataProperty.ValidationMessage
